Ok, all this "e" as in "let" stuff is killing me so here:
http://cinch.fm/lbergen/275225

Admittedly, I got a little sloppy on the last word (cirlrfu) but I attribute
that to the fact that my tongue is still getting used to trilling and
back-to-back syllables with "r" in it are like an obstacle course for my
tongue (ta'o still expressing relief at having sorpreka to save me from
having to say sorprekarce .u'i)

Also, listening to myself again I think I screwed up on the emphasis... oh
well.

